        "original_id": "33e788f9-6231-5df4-8f2c-ab8b57135fd1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Stacey McClean, Biff Byford, Frankie Sandford, Jay Asforis, Daisy Evans, Calvin Goldspink, Aaron Renfree, Hannah Richings, Rochelle Wiseman\n- Organizations: S Club 8, Saxon\n- Events: S Club Search\n- Roles: English singer, lead singer\n\nFacts:\n- Peter Rodney \"Biff\" Byford was born on 15 January 1951 and is an English singer.\n- In 2001, Stacey McClean, Frankie Sandford, Jay Asforis, Daisy Evans, Calvin Goldspink, Aaron Renfree, Hannah Richings, and Rochelle Wiseman were chosen for S Club 8 from thousands of hopefuls on the television series \"S Club Search\" while they were all in their early teens or younger.\n- Stacey McClean was born on 17 February 1989 and is an English solo singer.\n- Biff Byford is best known as the lead singer of the heavy metal band Saxon.",
